OL,3,GNEWSAFunding boost to help restore
OL,4,Awater vole population
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife charity hopes funding of
OL,7,F#760,000 will help the water vole
OL,8,Fpopulation in Nottinghamshire to
OL,9,F"thrive again".
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Wildlife Trust said it
OL,12,Fhad secured government funding for its
OL,13,Finitiatives to bring back water voles
OL,14,Fand prepare for the return of beavers
OL,15,Fto the county.
OL,17,FPart of the funding will be used to
OL,18,F"eradicate" non-native mink in
OL,19,FNottinghamshire, which the charity said
OL,20,Fthreatened vole populations.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
