OL,3,GNEWSAFunding boost to help restore
OL,4,Awater vole population
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the trust said
OL,7,Frecovering voles and wild beavers will
OL,8,Fbenefit other plants and animals in the
OL,9,Fcounty that depend on healthy wetlands
OL,10,Fand river systems.
